{"nodes": [{"id": "vault_adr_0205_hand_overs_on_the_drop_and_the_bass_by_hand_decision", "label": "ADR 0205: Hand-overs on the drop and the bass by hand", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "vault/adr/0205-hand-overs-on-the-drop-and-the-bass-by-hand.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The user (2026-11-27): the incoming song's drop must line up with where the bass changes hands, a song must never stay 4+ bars without bass while the other's intro has 16 bars to go, bass cut or opened over parts of a track, several clips selected, press and hold to grab. ADR 0200 put the in-point on the first downbeat, so a 32-bar intro left the outgoing song without its bass 16 bars early. The loudness curve cannot see a bassline under a kick-heavy intro, so drops come from the waveform's lows. Alternatives rejected: a drop from loudness only; a new low-band curve in the analysis (the cached Prepare waveform already has the lows); moving the swap point to the drop with the in-point kept; a multi-select that ripples like a single drag. Thresholds are from synthetic tests: [UNVERIFIED] on real songs, the user's listening decides."}, {"id": "vault_adr_0205_hand_overs_on_the_drop_and_the_bass_by_hand_drops_from_the_lows", "label": "Drops found from the waveform's lows", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "vault/adr/0205-hand-overs-on-the-drop-and-the-bass-by-hand.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A house intro with a kick is often as loud as its drop, so loudness hides where the bassline comes in. The lows (under 200 Hz) at 150 points a second are already in the cached Prepare waveform. A bassline holds the lows up; a kick alone falls away between beats. Without a waveform the loudness rule stays as the fallback."}, {"id": "vault_adr_0205_hand_overs_on_the_drop_and_the_bass_by_hand_incoming_on_its_drop", "label": "Incoming song comes in on its drop", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "vault/adr/0205-hand-overs-on-the-drop-and-the-bass-by-hand.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The in-point is chosen so the first drop lands where the bass changes hands, so the outgoing song never plays without its bass while the incoming one is still in its intro. A shorter intro comes in from its first downbeat and the swap sits on its drop. Keeps the outgoing phrase placement (before its outro)."}, {"id": "vault_adr_0205_hand_overs_on_the_drop_and_the_bass_by_hand_bass_spans", "label": "Bass cut or opened over part of a song (SetItem.lows)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "vault/adr/0205-hand-overs-on-the-drop-and-the-bass-by-hand.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "ADR 0203 let a hand-over's bass be chosen as a whole; this covers part of a song outside a hand-over. Spans {from, to, on} in beats, applied last over whatever the hand-overs do there; trimming keeps them."}, {"id": "vault_adr_0205_hand_overs_on_the_drop_and_the_bass_by_hand_several_selected", "label": "Several songs selected on the timeline", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "vault/adr/0205-hand-overs-on-the-drop-and-the-bass-by-hand.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Shift or Ctrl + click; dragging moves them together (moveSongs) and the others stay put. A ripple multi-select was rejected because it equals selecting the first song alone."}, {"id": "vault_adr_0205_hand_overs_on_the_drop_and_the_bass_by_hand_press_and_hold", "label": "Press and hold to grab a song", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "vault/adr/0205-hand-overs-on-the-drop-and-the-bass-by-hand.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A song not selected is grabbed by pressing and holding still for 350 ms; it selects and lifts the song, then it can be dragged."}], "edges": [{"source": "vault_adr_0205_hand_overs_on_the_drop_and_the_bass_by_hand_decision", "target": "vault_adr_0200_planning_a_set_on_phrases_decision", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/adr/0205-hand-overs-on-the-drop-and-the-bass-by-hand.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_adr_0205_hand_overs_on_the_drop_and_the_bass_by_hand_decision", "target": "vault_adr_0201_a_set_shaped_by_hand_and_heard_live_decision", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/adr/0205-hand-overs-on-the-drop-and-the-bass-by-hand.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_adr_0205_hand_overs_on_the_drop_and_the_bass_by_hand_decision", "target": "vault_adr_0203_whose_bass_plays_in_a_hand_over_decision", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/adr/0205-hand-overs-on-the-drop-and-the-bass-by-hand.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_adr_0205_hand_overs_on_the_drop_and_the_bass_by_hand_decision", "target": "vault_adr_0204_glue_home_mixes_the_set_decision", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/adr/0205-hand-overs-on-the-drop-and-the-bass-by-hand.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_adr_0205_hand_overs_on_the_drop_and_the_bass_by_hand_decision", "target": "src_core_sets_plan", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/adr/0205-hand-overs-on-the-drop-and-the-bass-by-hand.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_adr_0205_hand_overs_on_the_drop_and_the_bass_by_hand_decision", "target": "src_core_sets_automation", "relation": "ref